Specifications
--------------

No specification or schema text is reproduced, and no specification
document or schema is redistributed. Element names, namespaces and
enumeration values are interface facts every implementation must use.

- OASIS Common Alerting Protocol Version 1.2 (and the CAP 1.1 and 1.0
  namespaces, read as 1.2), copyright OASIS Open.
- W3C XML Signature Syntax and Processing, Atom (RFC 4287), RSS 2.0,
  GeoJSON (RFC 7946): used for facts only.

